Scope
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT License above covers this project's own source code, text and
original material. It does not cover the following, which stay under their
own terms:

- Mythic Bastionland. Mythic Bastionland, its text, art and trade dress are
  (c) Chris McDowall, Bastionland Press. All rights reserved. None of its text
  is included here: the rules the system shows in the book's own words are
  read at runtime from the user's own copy of the rulebook. The repository
  holds only the page each passage is on and a fingerprint of its letters
  (module/rules/book-prints.js), from which no text can be read back. The
  name Mythic Bastionland is his, and no rights in it are granted.

- The Realm terrain, Holdings and Landmarks traced from the free Blank Realm
  sheet's map legend, (c) Chris McDowall, Bastionland Press, under
  assets/realm/ and in scripts/data/realm-sheet-art.json. They are included
  with Chris McDowall's permission, and that permission does not pass on to
  anyone else.

- Heraldic charges and the Armorial Realm skin (assets/heraldry/charges/,
  assets/realm/armorial/ and each skin's seat.svg), adapted from the Book of
  Traceable Heraldic Art, (c) 2016-2023 Matthew Simon Ryan Cavalletto, under
  CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).

- Icons from game-icons.net, under CC BY 3.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). Credits are in each file and
  in the CREDITS.md files under assets/icons/.

- Fonts under assets/fonts/, under the SIL Open Font License. The licence
  texts are in assets/fonts/licenses/.

See the Credits and Copyright sections of README.md for details.
